$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'; $d = Join-Path $env:TEMP 'agent-control-pr59-review-6c49852a-v1'; if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $d) { Remove-Item -LiteralPath $d -Recurse -Force }; & git clone --branch 'feature/agent-control-plane-v2-20260928' --single-branch 'https://github.com/fengie/mhw-mods.git' $d; if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { exit $LASTEXITCODE }; & git -C $d checkout --detach '6c49852a72ba23d50cfca6ac77b1104c37728aa4'; if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { exit $LASTEXITCODE }; $actual = (& git -C $d rev-parse HEAD).Trim(); if ($actual -ne '6c49852a72ba23d50cfca6ac77b1104c37728aa4') { Write-Error ('HEAD_MISMATCH=' + $actual); exit 42 }; $prompt = 'You are the independent release reviewer for Agent Manager / Agent Control PR #59.
Review exact commit 6c49852a72ba23d50cfca6ac77b1104c37728aa4, based on canonical main aba60bf19c09da2d0558031bb2bbbf06362e3621. Do not modify files, commit, push, or publish anything.

Inspect the code and diff, not prior prose claims. Focus on P0/P1 release blockers:
- authenticated heaven2 control to heaven heavy-worker execution uses the existing Heaven Local Bridge and fails closed if unavailable;
- local and remote Codex launch uses approval never plus workspace-write sandbox, with no approve-for-me or dangerous bypass;
- heaven2 remains control and credential authority while heaven only gets explicit scoped repository-write authorization;
- remote patch transfer preserves new, modified, and deleted files and returned work is pushed from the credential-authority side;
- bridge status vocabulary matches real done/completed/error/failure/timeout/cancel behavior;
- relay lock recovery cannot be permanently wedged by a dead owner;
- remote stop/cancel behavior and process ownership are fail-closed;
- federated registry uses stable identity, provider abstraction, heartbeat freshness, stale/disconnected semantics, reconnect behavior, mixed runtime support, and accurate live counts;
- planning suppresses obvious duplicate manager/main/lane ownership without counting historical agents as live;
- structured verification/review evidence is authorized appropriately and cannot be inferred from prose;
- dashboard, CLI, autopilot, docs and version metadata match actual behavior;
- reconciliation preserved canonical v8.8.5 main changes and branch is not overwriting newer release work.

Run npm run check and npm test under tools/agent-control as part of the review. You may use git diff and inspect any relevant files. Treat source or test gaps that can violate the above as blockers.

End with exactly one verdict line:
REVIEW_VERDICT=APPROVED
or
REVIEW_VERDICT=CHANGES_REQUESTED

Before that line, list any blocking findings with file/function references. If there are no blocking findings, explicitly say BLOCKERS=0 and summarize residual non-blocking limitations.'; $prompt | codex -a never -s read-only exec --skip-git-repo-check -C $d -; if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { exit $LASTEXITCODE }
